"""Wiki doc pages for Kee, the Wiki's AI (release 1): the user pages (Kee in
the editor, page summaries, Ask Kee, limits and notices, the tools Ask Kee
reads with) and the admin pages (providers and models, switches and
permissions, limits and usage, data handling). Facts come from the depotex
repo: libs/platform/ai and its Settings screens in libs/platform-ui
(src/admin/routes/settings/ai), apps/wiki/backend/internal/kee and
internal/tools, apps/wiki/frontend/src/components/kee, and their developer
guides (doc/internal-dev-doc/ai, wiki, wiki-tools, wiki-agents,
wiki-outside-apps, wiki-attachment-text). Keep in step with them. Release 2
(proposals, agents, outside AI apps, scheduled help) adds the pages in
content_kee_r2.py and the sections below that mention them. Only what is
built is described."""
from engine import H, P, UL, OL, TABLE, NOTE, WARN, STEPS, SHOT

